  "slug": "training-attendance-request-form",
  "title": "Training Attendance Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this request to route the need, test readiness, document review, authorize a bounded action, and verify implementation for a training attendance workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational training attendance request form that controls a controlled learning-session attendance and participation record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the training coordinator, facilitator, manager, or learner needs a traceable request so the authorized learning, compliance, safety, or qualification reviewer can credit attendance, assign partial credit, require make-up, correct the roster, or withhold completion under the approved curriculum, roster rules, prerequisite matrix, delivery standard, and qualification policy without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
